 "title": {
  "rendered": "第七境纲领"
 },
 "content": {
  "rendered": "\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">                                                                     《道境》</p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"has-text-align-center wp-block-paragraph\">天道酬勤，道法自然。</p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"has-text-align-center wp-block-paragraph\">道若不同，不相为谋。</p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"has-text-align-center wp-block-paragraph\">七境之内，皆为吾辈。</p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"has-text-align-center wp-block-paragraph\">七境之外，同仇敌忾。</p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"has-text-align-center wp-block-paragraph\">《圣经》</p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"has-text-align-center wp-block-paragraph\">神不爱世人，世人应自爱。</p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"has-text-align-center wp-block-paragraph\">神不悯世人，世人应自怜。</p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"has-text-align-center wp-block-paragraph\">神不存当世，世人应自信。</p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"has-text-align-center wp-block-paragraph\">神非救世主，世人应自救。</p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"has-text-align-center wp-block-paragraph\">道 &#8211; 是自然之法</p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"has-text-align-center wp-block-paragraph\">法 &#8211; 是道德之线</p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"has-text-align-center wp-block-paragraph\">神 &#8211; 是无知之仰</p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"has-text-align-center wp-block-paragraph\">见天地，见众生，唯不见神迹。</p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"has-text-align-center wp-block-paragraph\">华夏五千年文明生生不息，全靠众生，从无神显，生死有命，人定胜天，天道轮回，死而复生，不生不灭，是为永生。</p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"has-text-align-center wp-block-paragraph\">故而永生之法不在肉身，在文明之灵的传承，觉醒之日，便是悟道之时。</p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"has-text-align-center wp-block-paragraph\">好好活着，好好奋斗，好好恋爱，好好生育，好好教育下一代，好好传承，好好享受这短暂的一生，钱，乃身外物，一但参透，则朝闻道，夕死可矣。</p>\n",
  "protected": false
 }
}